    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strip Miner takes the simple  loop of sandbox strip mining and turns it into a casual roguelike mining experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start every run just below the surface of a massive drill shaft, armed with your corporate-issued mining tool. Mine and deposit ores to afford items and upgrades to assist you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to submit quota. Fail, and you will be forgotten. Succeed, and you receive a replenished corporate-issued tool, because only the best bots may continue digging.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strip Miner takes the simple  loop of sandbox strip mining and turns it into a casual roguelike mining experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start every run just below the surface of a massive drill shaft, armed with your corporate-issued mining tool. Mine and deposit ores to afford items and upgrades to assist you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to submit quota. Fail, and you will be forgotten. Succeed, and you receive a replenished corporate-issued tool, because only the best bots may continue digging.</p>",
